ida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_67":251},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_42":253,"_49":60,"_44":254,"_54":255,"_63":-7,"_13":256,"_65":257},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_67":258},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_42":260,"_49":60,"_44":261,"_54":262,"_63":-7,"_13":263,"_65":264},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_67":265},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_42":267,"_49":60,"_44":268,"_54":269,"_63":-7,"_13":270,"_65":271},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_67":272},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_42":274,"_49":60,"_44":275,"_54":276,"_63":-7,"_13":277,"_65":278},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_67":279},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_42":281,"_49":60,"_44":282,"_54":283,"_63":-7,"_13":284,"_65":285},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_67":286},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_42":288,"_49":60,"_44":289,"_54":290,"_63":-7,"_13":291,"_65":292},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_67":293},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_197":296},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg>",{"_42":299,"_49":60,"_44":236,"_54":300,"_63":-7,"_13":301,"_65":302},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx","Elige la política de admisión y conecta DMS, confianza inicial y cliente EST.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview",{"_67":303},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/overview.mdx",{"_49":50,"_44":305,"_51":-7,"_53":-7,"_54":-7,"_56":-7,"_46":306,"_42":314,"_65":315,"_63":317},"Integraciones",[307],{"_42":308,"_49":60,"_44":309,"_54":310,"_63":-7,"_13":311,"_65":312},"es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_67":313},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aw